"Kalis's spread of Insights bred an arcane blight, and a Conclave then limited Insights for mortals."
"Years later, in the Ostren war, he casts force-blade swarms and a dome that counters spells."
"He tells Nathan Lark that those who start without teachers must find their own power."
"At the Conclave he shields the Heirs in a displacing barrier and reveals Evesor hired assassins."
"In Conclave duels he seizes all mana in an area, fires disintegration fast, and wins three duels."
"Kamus of the gold tower craves his attention."
"Nine years later his strong dispels serve the defense of Dawn's Concord."
